"title":"Mario & Luigi Brothership","year":null,"platform":"","estHours":45,"released":"Yes","purchased":"Yes","excitement":null,"credits":"","hours":null,"platinum":"","duration":"","rating":null,"reasonDropped":"","notes":"","blownAway":"","stunner":"","bummer":"","tooLong":"","tooShort":"","focus":"","worthIt":"","status":"Waiting for patch","cover":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/0f/Mario_%26_Luigi_-_Brothership_%28cover_art%29.jpg","hltbId":152369,"hltb":49.3},{"id":"g80","title":"Monster Hunter Rise","year":null,"platform":"","estHours":15,"released":"Yes","purchased":"Yes","excitement":6,"credits":"","hours":null,"platinum":"","duration":"","rating":null,"reasonDropped":"","notes":"","blownAway":"","stunner":"","bummer":"","tooLong":"","tooShort":"","focus":"","worthIt":"","status":"Dropped","cover":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/41/Monster_hunter_rise_cover.jpg","hltbId":83169,"hltb":82.7}],"journal":[{"id":"j13","game":"Outer Wilds","text":"I wrote a whole ass video on this lmao","date":"","gameId":"g29"},{"id":"j29","game":"The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom","text":"This was simply everything I've ever wanted in a video game. A grand adventure with every bit as much heart and charm as it is dark and twisted. The game absolutely has it's flaws, but when you swing for the fences like TOTK does, there will be a few strikes. That didnt stop this from being a grand slam. The world is so interconnected, being at any of the 3 levels constantly gave you reason to go visit another level. The side quests were often a little tedious, but most of the time they only added value to the world and fleshed out it's inhabitants. MYstery abounded and even though the prize for completing certain things might have been a little underwhelming, it was the mystery leading up to it and the sense of discovery that made it shine. The Dungeons never disapointed even if they were a far cry from what old 3D Zelda dungeons were like. They had character, they were challenging, and the boss fights were exciting. The Gerudo dungeon was easily my fave. And the ending. OH MY GOD THE ENDING. What a final boss. And the ending sequence was just magical. I cried when I beat it. I balled when Link reached out for Zelda as they fell thru the sky and a subtle rendition of Zelda's lullaby played. Incredible game. If it was the only game I could play for the rest of my life, I'd be perfectly happy.","date":"","gameId":"g5"},{"id":"j49","game":"Resident Evil 4 Remake","text":"HOLY SHIT WHAT A GAME. I forgot how special a really polished non-Nintendo triple AAA game can be.\r\n\r\nThis was fire from beginning to end. I had the wrong impression of Resi. I thought it was this uber-serious harcore horror series. And it kind of is, but its also SO silly and video gamey sometimes! Like some of this was so shamelessly corny and it worked. I had so much just genuine fun with this game dude.\r\n\r\nShooters continually baffle me, I suck at them, I get frustrated and I certainly have issues with the combat in this game. But I really don't think it has anything to do with the game itself, just my lack of skill with this type of combat haha. I was missing mfs at point blank range. I'm not him in these games. But everything else? Music, characters, level design, puzzles, LOCATION? This was a fucking adventure. Beautiful in the creepiest of ways. Loved it loved it loved it. I get why there are people obsessed with these games now lol. Easy masterpiece rating right here.","date":"","gameId":"g24"}],"shows":[{"id":"s1","tvmazeId":41469,"title":"Demon Slayer","premiered":"2019-04-06","showStatus":"Ended","network":"Fuji TV","genres":["Action","Anime","Fantasy","Horror"],"tvRating":7.9,"poster":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/456/1140750.jpg","seasons":[[1,26],[2,18],[3,11],[4,8]],"rt":"30x33,60,30x10,60,30x10,49,30x5,35,40","rating":null,"notes":"Watched season 1","status":"Paused","log":[{"year":2026,"upTo":26}],"fetc